Package: tlosint-whatsmyname
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, python3
Description: Username enumeration across sites
 WhatsMyName checks a username against several hundred websites using the
 WhatsMyName dataset and reports where an account of that name exists,
 writing HTML, CSV and JSON reports.
 .
 The site list is not shipped: the tool downloads wmn-data.json from the
 upstream WhatsMyName project on every run, before it parses its own
 arguments. It therefore needs network access even to print --help, and it
 cannot run at all offline.
 .
 Ships a self-contained virtualenv under /opt/tracelabs/whatsmyname so its
 dependency pins cannot collide with other OSINT tools on the system.
